{"sha": "9878e19c70dee7555a9128b0fc31d7eb6ba58e5d616562c6d1481b18814ab0a3", "body": ["\\begin{proposition}[三种电容器]\\label{prop:b1:potential-capacitors:three}", "\\index{平板电容器}\\index{球形电容器}\\index{柱形电容器}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 平板：面积为 $S$ 的极板，相距 $d \\ll \\sqrt S$：", "        $C = \\dfrac{\\varepsilon_0S}{d}$。", "  \\item 球形：半径分别为 $R_1 < R_2$ 的同心球面：", "        $C = \\dfrac{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0R_1R_2}{R_2 - R_1}$。", "  \\item 柱形（同轴），半径为 $a < b$，长度 $L \\gg b$：", "        $C = \\dfrac{2\\pi\\varepsilon_0L}{\\ln(b/a)}$。", "\\end{enumerate}", "在两极板之间填充相对介电常数为 $\\varepsilon_r$ 的绝缘体，", "使 $C$ 乘以 $\\varepsilon_r$（介质分子发生极化，", "削弱电场，常见塑料和玻璃的 $\\varepsilon_r = 2$ 至 $10$，", "水的为 $80$）。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "各种情形下，两极板之间的电场与", "\\cref{prop:b1:electrostatics-gauss:three}中的相同：$E = \\sigma/\\varepsilon_0 = Q/\\varepsilon_0S$，", "$U = Ed$；$E = Q/4\\pi\\varepsilon_0r^2$，$U = \\int_{R_1}^{R_2}E\\,\\dd r = \\dfrac{Q}{4\\pi\\varepsilon_0}", "\\Bigl(\\dfrac1{R_1} - \\dfrac1{R_2}\\Bigr)$；$E = Q/2\\pi\\varepsilon_0Lr$，$U =", "\\dfrac{Q}{2\\pi\\varepsilon_0L}\\ln\\dfrac ba$。以 $Q$ 除以 $U$ 即得。介质", "因子予以承认。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[电容器的能量]\\label{thm:b1:potential-capacitors:energy}", "\\index{电容器的能量}\\index{电场的能量密度}", "电荷量为 $Q$、电压为 $U$ 的电容器储存的能量为", "\\[", "W = \\tfrac12 CU^2 = \\tfrac12 QU = \\frac{Q^2}{2C} ,", "\\]", "即将电荷从一个极板移到另一个极板所需的功，", "克服不断增大的电压。对平板电容器，$W = \\tfrac12\\varepsilon_0E^2", "\\times Sd$：能量储存于电场中，其密度为 $\\tfrac12\\varepsilon_0E^2$", "每单位体积 --- 这一结论对任意", "静电场都成立。", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "将 $\\dd q$ 从负极板移到正极板，设此时电荷量为", "$q$，所需的功为 $\\dd W = (q/C)\\,\\dd q$；从 $0$ 积分到 $Q$。再", "代入 $C = \\varepsilon_0S/d$ 和 $U = Ed$；一般的能量密度予以承认。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}[三种电容器及其能量]\\label{ex:b1:potential-capacitors:energies}", "面积为一平方米的一对箔片，相距 \\qty{1}{mm}：$C = 8.85 \\times 10^{-12}/", "10^{-3} = \\qty{8.9}{nF}$ --- 法拉是一个非常大的单位。除颤器的", "\\qty{150}{\\micro F}、\\qty{2}{kV} 的电容器：能量为 \\qty{300}{J}，在毫秒内释放。", "\\qty{3000}{F}、\\qty{2.7}{V} 的超级电容器，在", "一个与汽水瓶同样大小的罐中可储存 \\qty{11}{kJ} 能量 --- 其电容来自", "极小的分子间隙 $d$ 与极大的多孔面积 $S$。空气击穿时电场的能量密度", "为 $\\tfrac12\\varepsilon_0(3 \\times 10^6)^2 = \\qty{40}{J/m^3}$，这正是", "电容器比电池储存能量少得多的原因。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, x=1cm, y=1cm, >=Stealth]", "  \\begin{scope}", "    \\draw[omThm, very thick] (-1.5,1) -- (1.5,1) node[right, font=\\footnotesize] {$+Q$, $V_1$};", "    \\draw[omDef, very thick] (-1.5,-1) -- (1.5,-1) node[right, font=\\footnotesize] {$-Q$, $V_2$};", "    \\foreach \\x in {-1.1,-0.55,0,0.55,1.1} \\draw[omProp, ->] (\\x,0.9) -- (\\x,-0.85);", "    \\draw[omProp, dashed] (-1.55,0.9) .. controls (-2.2,0.5) and (-2.2,-0.5) .. (-1.55,-0.85);", "    \\draw[omProp, dashed] (1.55,0.9) .. controls (2.2,0.5) and (2.2,-0.5) .. (1.55,-0.85);", "    \\draw[<->] (-2.6,1) -- (-2.6,-1) node[midway, left, font=\\footnotesize] {$d$};", "    \\node[font=\\footnotesize] at (0,-1.7) {平板：$C = \\varepsilon_0S/d$};", "    \\node[font=\\footnotesize, omProp, fill=white, inner sep=1.5pt] at (0.27,0.3) {$E = U/d$};", "  \\end{scope}", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=6.2cm]", "    \\draw[omDef, very thick] (0,0) circle (1.3);", "    \\draw[omThm, very thick, fill=omThm!15] (0,0) circle (0.55);", "    \\foreach \\a in {0,60,...,300} \\draw[omProp, ->] (0,0) ++({\\a}:0.6) -- ++({\\a}:0.6);", "    \\draw[<->] (0,0) -- (225:0.55) node[midway, above left, font=\\scriptsize] {$R_1$};", "    \\draw[<->] (0,0) -- (-20:1.3) node[pos=0.75, below, font=\\scriptsize] {$R_2$};", "    \\node[font=\\footnotesize] at (0,-1.7) {球形（柱形见正文）};", "  \\end{scope}", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=11.2cm]", "    \\fill[omExo!25] (-1.2,-0.95) rectangle (1.2,0.95);", "    \\draw[omThm, very thick] (-1.2,1) -- (1.2,1);", "    \\draw[omDef, very thick] (-1.2,-1) -- (1.2,-1);", "    \\node[font=\\footnotesize] at (0,0) {$\\varepsilon_r$};", "    \\node[font=\\footnotesize] at (0,-1.7) {介质填充：$C \\to \\varepsilon_rC$};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 平板、球形及介质填充电容器。电场", "（橙色）被限制在两极板之间，仅在边缘处有边缘效应，", "当 $d$ 很小时可忽略；能量 $\\tfrac12\\varepsilon_0E^2$", "为每单位体积的能量，储存于该电场中。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{remark}[电容器的组合]\\label{rem:b1:potential-capacitors:association}", "并联（电压 $U$ 相同）时电荷相加：$C = C_1 + C_2$；串联", "（电荷 $Q$ 相同）时电压相加：$1/C = 1/C_1 + 1/C_2$ --- 与", "电阻相反，因为 $C$ 衡量的是容易程度（每伏所储电荷），而 $R$", "衡量的是困难程度。这些规律由 $Q = CU$ 以及", "\\cref{ch:b1:dc-circuits}中的电路定律推出。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\section{练习}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:potential-capacitors:1}", "求距 \\qty{1.0}{\\micro C} 电荷 \\qty{1.0}{m} 处的电势；求将另一个", "\\qty{1.0}{\\micro C} 的电荷由无穷远处移至该点所需的能量；", "若其质量为 \\qty{1}{g} 且被释放，求它飞离时的速率。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:potential-capacitors:2}", "两极板相距 \\qty{1.0}{mm}，电压为 \\qty{100}{V}：求电场；求", "电子从静止穿过间隙时获得的动能和速率；", "求飞行时间。", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}